  "historyNote": "#5635, eff 6-7-93; ss by #7006, INTERIM, eff 5-26-99, EXPIRED: 9-23-99 New. #8957, eff 7-27-07, EXPIRED: 7-27-15 New. #11039, INTERIM, eff 2-24-16, EXPIRES: 8-22-16; ss by #11161, eff 8-20-16; ss by #14074, eff 9-20-24, EXPIRES: 9-20-34 (formerly He-P 810.04)",
